The charged review already scoped the weak point: GGV’s degree-preserving subrectangular result is for a pair realizing the global minimum of `gcd(deg P, deg Q)`, not for an arbitrary orbit-minimal representative. I’m now checking the actual GGV propositions around Sections 4-6 so the report can distinguish source theorem from campaign inference.
