+## 4. Top Form and Root Count
+
+In the subrectangular gauge, `(a,b) in Supp(P)` and every support point of `P`
+lies in the rectangle `0<=i<=a`, `0<=j<=b`. The only point of that rectangle
+with total degree `a+b` is `(a,b)`. Hence
