+## 2. GGV's Theorem, Precisely
+
+GGV Section 4 defines
+
+```text
+B = infinity, if JC is true;
+B = min gcd(v_11(P),v_11(Q)), if JC is false,
+    where (P,Q) runs over all counterexamples.
+```
