+GGV Definition 4.3: for coprime `m,n>1`, an `(m,n)`-pair is a Jacobian pair
+`(P,Q)` in `L(l)` such that
+
+```text
+v_11(P)/v_11(Q) = v_10(P)/v_10(Q) = m/n,
+v_(1,-1)(en_10(P)) < 0.
+```
+
+It is **standard** if `P,Q in L` and `v_(1,-1)(st_10(P))<0`.
